\textbf{XMusic}~\cite{xmusic2025} is a novel framework for controllable symbolic music generation. It supports flexible multi-modal prompts including images, video, text, tags and humming. % Existing music generation systems usually face the challenges of effectively controlling musical emotions and ensuring high-quality outputs. 
% Parsing and extracting multi-modal information is one of the key challenges in existing approaches. For this issue, XMusic intoduces a multi-modal parsing method, XProjector, to map various prompt types into symbolic music elements within a projection space, encompassing emotions, genres, rhythms, and notes. XComposer, the music generation component, consists of a Generator and a Selector. The Generator creates emotionally controllable and melodious music based on an innovative symbolic music representation. The Selector employs a multi-task learning scheme to identify high-quality music by evaluating quality, emotions, and genres.
Parsing and extracting multi-modal information is one of the key challenges in existing approaches. XMusic addresses the challenge through two key components. XProjector maps multi-modal prompts into symbolic music elements, considering aspects like emotion, genre, and rhythm.  XComposer, which comprises a generator and a selector, produces emotionally controllable music. The generator utilizes an innovative symbolic representation to create music, while the selector employs a multi-task learning approach to evaluate quality and musical attributes.



