% \textbf{Building Large-Scale, Comprehensive, and Aligned multi-modal Datasets.} Constructing multi-modal datasets that are large-scale, comprehensive, and highly aligned across modalities to support the training of large-scale multi-modal music models.

% \textbf{Developing a Comprehensive and Systematic multi-modal Music Evaluation Framework.} Creating an evaluation system that not only accurately assesses the quality of generated music but also evaluates its artistic value, creativity, and modality consistency across multiple dimensions.

% \textbf{Improving Quality, Efficiency, Professionalism, Controllability, and Editability.} Enhancing the quality and efficiency of music generation, increasing its professionalism, controllability, and editability to expand its application scope, and improving user-friendliness to lower the barrier to entry. Ultimately, achieving the widespread adoption of multi-modal music generation technology in both professional and everyday scenarios.

\begin{itemize}
    \item By introducing multi-modal information to inspire the creativity of music generation models, generating creative music rather than merely imitating and piecing together training data.
    \item Improving generation efficiency while ensuring quality through comprehensive optimization at the algorithmic architecture and hardware-software levels, enabling real-time music generation.
    \item Comprehensively utilizing pretrained models from different fields and modalities, combining them into high-performance multi-modal music generation models.
    % \item Fusing multi-modal information such as text, images, and audio to jointly guide music generation.
