\RedMulE{} extends the open-source RedMulE accelerator, enabling fault tolerance through a combination of data path redundancy, control path duplication, and data protection using parity bits and \cgls{ecc}.
The primary goal of this work is to enable runtime-configurable reliability while minimizing area overhead and performance impact.
