The participants then selected themes for further discussion collectively, which lasted for approximately 1 hour.  The
conversation was recorded for later review. The documentation generated was then recirculated, allowing the practitioner
coauthors to add further comment as desired.  The findings reported in the next section reflect both the initial written
comments, the transcript of the conversation, the further notes provided and the facilitators notes made during the
meeting.  The results presented below therefore represent the \emph{themes} discovered during the retrospective process,
rather than the original questions asked. Discussions focused on elaborating the meaning of the themes and identifying
actions that then constituted our recommendations.

