Moreover, we adopt Equation~\eqref{eqn:total-score} to generate the benchmark score for a comprehensive evaluation. Specifically, the accuracy ratio represents how accurately the model can perform with the WNLI~\cite{elfwing2017sigmoidweightedlinearunitsneural} benchmark. The memory ratio shows how well the model can be compressed compared to the original model size. The throughput at the prefill stage and the decode stage represents how efficiently the tokens can be processed at each stage, respectively. We achieve a score of 0.55 compared to the baseline score of 0.4. 
