The rest of the work is organized as follows. In Section~\ref{sec:methodology}, we describe the manifold learning-GPR framework developed to learn data-driven ROMs suitable for the bifurcation analysis task. The two flow configurations employed to demonstrate the methodology are illustrated in Section~\ref{sec:layout}, and results are discussed in Section~\ref{sec:results}. Conclusions are finally provided in Section~\ref{sec:conclusions}.
