The projection of the high-dimensional flow field on the five leading modes are shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:POD_modes}(i)-(j) and Fig.~\ref{fig:POD_modes_BIF}(i)-(j), for Reynolds number values both below (left panels) and above (right panels) the critical thresholds $Re_{cr} \approx 49$ and $Re_{sb} \approx 44$. 
